def IsWhat(number):
    if number <= 1:
        return False
    else:
        for i in range(2, int(number**0.5) + 1):
            if number % i == 0:
                return False
    return True

________________________________________________________________________________

De functie IsWhat retourneert "False" en "True" voor argumenten 14 en 23.
